      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Coronary MR angiography is a new noninvasive diagnostic method in rapid evolution. It has the potential to combine structural information with functional assessment of coronary blood flow. Advances in technology will undoubtedly lead to enhanced resolution, improved accuracy, and shorter scan times. It is certain that coronary MR angiography will be a prominent diagnostic clinical tool in the years to come."},
